#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# continued_fraction

#% text
# `continued_fraction(x)` gives the terms of the continued fraction of `x`.

#% text
# `continued_fraction(x, n)` gives at most `n` terms.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# A rational number has a finite continued fraction. A quadratic irrational, such as `sqrt(2)`, has a periodic one: its period forms a final sublist.

#% item
# Other exact irrationals need a count `n`; machine numbers and balls give the terms their precision supports.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
continued_fraction(415/93)
#% output
#= [4, 2, 6, 7]

#% cell
continued_fraction(sqrt(2))
#% output
#= [1, [2]]

#% cell
continued_fraction(pi, 10)
#% output
#= [3, 7, 15, 1, 292, 1, 1, 1, 2, 1]

#% cell
continued_fraction(1/2 + sqrt(5)/2)
#% output
#= [[1]]

#% subsection
# Scope

#% text
# A machine number:

#% cell
continued_fraction(3.14159)
#% output
#= [3, 7, 15, 1, 25, 1, 7]

#% text
# Other quadratic irrationals:

#% cell
continued_fraction(sqrt(19))
#% output
#= [4, [2, 1, 3, 1, 2, 8]]

#% cell
continued_fraction(3/2 + sqrt(7)/2)
#% output
#= [2, [1, 4, 1, 1]]

#% text
# `e` has a regular pattern:

#% cell
continued_fraction(e, 15)
#% output
#= [2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 4, 1, 1, 6, 1, 1, 8, 1, 1, 10]

#% subsection
# Applications

#% text
# The best rational approximations of `pi`, from the convergents:

#% cell
table(from_continued_fraction(continued_fraction(pi, k)), k, 4)
#% output
#= [3, 22/7, 333/106, 355/113]

#% subsection
# Properties and relations

#% text
# `from_continued_fraction` inverts it; the value comes back in another form:

#% cell
v = from_continued_fraction(continued_fraction(sqrt(13)))

#% cell
[n(v, 20), n(sqrt(13), 20)]
#% output
#= [3.605551275463989293119221, 3.605551275463989293119221]

#% subsection
# Possible issues

#% text
# A quadratic irrational over a common denominator is not recognized; split the fraction:

#% cell
continued_fraction((1 + sqrt(5))/2)
#% output
#= continued_fraction((1/2)*(1 + 5^(1/2)))

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `from_continued_fraction`, `rationalize`, `real_digits`
